(text "Every known connection is drawn. Wire colour = confidence; solid = verified (photo, confirmed, measured), dashed = datasheet or assumed:\n  measured — Checked on the board with a meter.\n  confirmed — Silkscreen label, a wire seen soldered to the pad, or a measurement in REPAIR_LOG.md.\n  photo — Trace, copper area or tinned strip followed in a close-up photo.\n  datasheet — Pin function from the part's datasheet; the part number itself is read from the photo.\n  assumed — Standard circuit practice or placement only. Treat as a hypothesis.\nOpen pins are UNKNOWN, not unconnected. Generated from model.yaml and annotations.json." (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4e58e7a8-0f32-508c-859d-cda22622946f"))
